[en.DECISION_C12_EEL_EXECUTION_PLAN]
Initiate Investigation

[en.DECISION_C12_EEL_EXECUTION_PLAN_desc]
The strange earthquakes have caused heavy losses to our rock farm, with many ponies refusing to enter the mines to work. We are currently in a state of crisis and need to organize an immediate investigation to explain the recent series of earthquakes and determine if there is any connection to the radar station.

[zh.DECISION_C12_EEL_EXECUTION_PLAN]
启动调查计划

[zh.DECISION_C12_EEL_EXECUTION_PLAN_desc]
奇怪的地震让我们的采石农场损失惨重，许多小马拒绝进入矿坑工作，一时间马马自危，我们需要立即组织调查来解释最近的一系列地震，以及是否存在的和雷达站的关联。
